--
-- Enforcement is still OFF. This adds policies; `FORCE ROW LEVEL SECURITY` —
-- the thing that makes them apply to the table owner, i.e. to the application —
-- lives in migrations/manual/rls-force-enable.sql and is the Faz 4 cutover.
